WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.900
Tangare ka Lingani mɔgɔw lo. Fanga min tun b'u fɛ, u y'o lakali jamana wɛrɛ kɔnɔ.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.794
Garango dugu la, mɔgɔw ka ɲi k'u yɛrɛ majigi. A kɔrɔla ani a tɛ kuma ɲɔgɔn fɛ.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.450
" Kuntigi sara, jamana bɛɛ bɛ ŋunana. Nka, an b'a fɛ k'o kɛ.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.064
Cɛɛ dɔ t'a fɛ ka kɔnɔni kɛ.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.696
Ne mako tɛ mɔgɔ si la.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.010
O kɔ, a ka masafugula biri a kun na. Diinan mɔgɔkɔrɔw y'u ɲɛɛ biri duguma k'a sɔrɔ u ma foyi fɔ.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:39.780
Masafugulan jigira ka ben. A be taga n'a ye. A be segira ka ben.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.794
Sanfɔɲɔba dɔ wurira, ka siman lajigi foro kɔnɔ. Mɔgɔw b'u yɛrɛ mabɔ a la.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.104
U b'a fɔ ko ni Linganiw tɛ yen, o masafugulan tɛna se ka sigi.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.048
O kɔ, diinan mɔgɔkɔrɔw ka ɲi k'o kuntigi sugandi.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.552
U y'a ta ka taga n'a ye Tangaré sira kan.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.168
Tangaré ye Lingani dugumɔgɔw ka dugu lo ye.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.568
A filɛ, min be nana.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:03:00.242
Ala ye mɔgɔ min woloma, ale be don kɛnɛma. Mɔgɔ si t'a lɔn fɛɛn min be kɛra yen.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.936
O labɛn tun dogonin lo ani an tɛna o fɔ tugun.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:29.602
Masacɛ ka masafugulan loon be surunyana. Masacɛ ka masafugula biri a kun na, k'a sigi.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.640
Kɔfɛ, sanji kɔsegira jamana kan.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:09.840
Mɔgɔw b'a fɔ ko hali bi, mɔgɔ si tɛ se ka sigi Garango dugu kunna ni a ma tɛmɛ Tangare dugu kan.
